{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"bd903999ae436ca8eae489de323c2c8546394290671bf22eec93da94ce38572a","digest":{"component_or_area":"authorship machinery (src/rebar/attest/authorship.py)","key_entities":["src/rebar/attest/authorship.py","sign_event_authorship","verify_event_authorship","authorship_content_hash","build_authorship_statement","sign_authorship","verify_authorship","DSSE Envelope","in-toto Statement/v1","application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json","event_uuid","content_hash","author_sig","subject","SHA-256"],"problem_keywords":["authorship payload format","in-toto statement","signature verification","content hash binding","DSSE envelope","event uuid","canonical JSON"],"propositions":["The authorship payload format must transition from raw event bytes to an in-toto Statement with subject binding event_uuid and content_hash, per approved epic design.","New functions sign_event_authorship and verify_event_authorship must implement DSSE signing/verification of in-toto Statements while preserving the low-level sign_authorship/verify_authorship primitive for KEY-op compatibility.","authorship_content_hash must compute SHA-256 hex digest over canonical event JSON with author_sig key excluded, such that signature presence does not affect the hash but any other field mutation changes it.","verify_event_authorship must validate that subject[0].name equals event_uuid and subject[0].digest.sha256 equals content_hash, returning non-verified Verdict (never raising) on malformed/missing Statement or unknown identity.","The in-toto Statement payload must conform to _type https://in-toto.io/Statement/v1 with predicateType application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json and empty predicate object."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785824107589657238,"uuid":"6f17ec7c-fe32-43cf-96f9-fdbfdcffbbb6"}